                                                 <https://w3id.org/fair-o#evidence> "Unique identifier check passed; persistence check failed."@en ;
                                                 <https://w3id.org/fair-o#forSubPrinciple> <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/F1> ;
                                                 <https://w3id.org/fair-o#testResult> <https://w3id.org/fair-o#Indeterminate> ;
                                                 <https://w3id.org/fair-o#value> 0.5 ;
                                                 <https://w3id.org/fair-o/ftr-alignment#derivedFromBenchmarkScore> <https://example.org/fair-assessment/benchmarkScoreF1> ;
                                                 <https://w3id.org/fair-o/ftr-alignment#derivedFromTestResult> <https://example.org/fair-assessment/testResultPersistentID> ,
